# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. Everything in public/ is copied verbatim into
# dist/client, which is the deploy root, so this file is what Pages reads.
#
# Send the www hostname to the apex so one canonical origin serves the site.
# Pages only consults this file for hostnames attached to the Pages project:
# until www.motedesktop.com is added there as a custom domain it resolves to
# Cloudflare's "is not set up yet" placeholder and this rule never runs.
https://www.motedesktop.com/* https://motedesktop.com/:splat 301
